  "description": "Welcome to D20Tek.Functional code library, this package contains a set of classes that improve the functional programming experience in C#. I based many of the library classes and api on F#'s functional capabilities to ensure smooth usage between the two: classes like Option, Result, and Choice; and methods like Iter, Bind, and Map. \nThe extensions for ASP.NET Core add functionality to working with controller-based webapi and minimal webapi. Making it easier to convert Result<T> into service endpoint responses.",
